# BAB 9. Extended Domain Schema (Financial & Operational Extensions)

## 9.1 Overview

Bab ini melengkapi DBDD dengan desain fisik domain yang pada rilis 0.1 (BAB 8.9) masih ditangguhkan. Domain-domain ini melanjutkan pola **database-per-service** (ADR-001) dan seluruh standar **BAB 2 (DBS-001…016)** — Common Columns, UUID PK, soft delete, optimistic locking, RLS berbasis `organization_id`, outbox/processed_event, indeks & enum via `CHECK`/tabel referensi. Aturan level field mengacu **BRD BAB 9** (BR-xxx) dan tidak diciptakan ulang.

| BAB | Domain                          | Basis Data (schema)          | Layanan     | BRD           |
| --- | ------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ----------- | ------------- |
| 9.2 | Fixed Asset                     | `fixedasset_db` (`fa`)       | SVC-020     | 9.5.7 (BR-586..595) |
| 9.3 | Cost & Profit Center            | `dimension_db` (`cc`,`pc`)   | SVC-021     | 9.5.10/9.5.11 (BR-616..635) |
| 9.4 | Budget Management               | `budget_db` (`bud`)          | SVC-022     | 9.5.12 (BR-636..645) |
| 9.5 | Financial Close                 | `financialclose_db` (`fcl`)  | SVC-023     | 9.5.14 (BR-656..665) |
| 9.6 | Financial Consolidation         | `consolidation_db` (`cons`)  | SVC-024     | 9.5.15 (BR-666..675) |
| 9.7 | Project Management              | `project_db` (`prj`)         | SVC-025     | 9.10 (BR-726..735) |
| 9.8 | Asset Management (operational)  | `asset_db` (`ast`)           | SVC-026     | 9.11 (BR-736..745) |
| 9.9 | Maintenance Management          | `maintenance_db` (`mnt`)     | SVC-027     | 9.16 (BR-786..795) |
| 9.10| Customer Relationship Mgmt      | `crm_db` (`crm`)             | SVC-028     | 9.15 (BR-776..785) |
| 9.11| Localization & Multi-Language   | `localization_db` (`loc`)    | SVC-029     | 9.19 (BR-816..825) |

> Referensi lintas layanan (mis. `financial_organization_id`, `account_id`, `fiscal_period_id`, `customer_id`, `item_id`, `warehouse_id`, `user_id`) bersifat **referensi logis** tanpa FK fisik. FK fisik hanya intra-basis-data.

